Subject: [PATCH 02/39] Eden (Doris): settings for PR #4324's two changes
 (defaults = PR #4324 behaviour)

- Shader loop limit (256 as in PR #4324; 512 to 8192, or no limit)
- Monster Hunter Rise record fix: always (as in PR #4324), only in MHR, or off;
  the log says when it rewrites a copy and in which game
